{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2013-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1373932800, "end_date": 1374623999, "month_true_total": 56, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:55:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "660062", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974599354", "personaname": "Garbus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/garbus/", "num_games_owned": 558, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2352, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1578, "last_played": 1434571884, "avatar": "6a1bb05822eb5654a5faaa607abdcc2e6ec4fe73"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game but you need at least 1 more friend to play with.\n+Big load of weapons, 7 core maps with story, realy big mass of aliens to kill, 4 classes- each can be played by 2 players\n±You see the game from the top\n-Sometimes the game is little buggy, if you play offline with bots they are not that cleaver as real players,", "timestamp_created": 1374593313, "timestamp_updated": 1374593313, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6365882", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064717084", "personaname": "Alphalight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/alphalightsk/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1242, "last_played": 1673677945, "avatar": "d32815d42398fd7d038a3fbbe4e8c3160584ac9d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played this game enough to be able to solo some missions. That's how much I like it. Simply put, it's good.\nIt has (or had) a small-ish community but that doesn't mean you can't have a blast!\nIf you like top-down shooters, then this game will feel right at home.\nThe only problem I had with it was the unlock system. If you want every item, you must reach level 30 once, which sucks as some weapons are pretty much necessary half the time (such as the medigun and the flamethrower).\nA few things make the game pretty hard though, such as friendly fire, \"perfect\" reloads (time it right and the reload doesn't take as long), and facehuggers that can kill you if you're not healed in time.\nIt's superb and it's free, so give it a try! One of the best games I've played. Cannot recommend it enough.", "timestamp_created": 1374585570, "timestamp_updated": 1573155089, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1922036", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999769158", "personaname": "Vincio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vincio/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 3541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3151, "last_played": 1589236434, "avatar": "d733f06e150208e987c6dc2844d7877414d70f34"}, "language": "english", "review": "You play online with friends slaying those pesky aliens, pew pew!\nIt's free.\nCoop with friends, 2 to 4 players, teamwork is the key!\nOh and it's free.\n♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ of weapons, achievements, too bad the campaign is short!\nDid I already mention it's F***ING FREE ?", "timestamp_created": 1374581102, "timestamp_updated": 1385415998, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 45, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.76780092716217041", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": 